OL,3,GNEWSABus driver critical after crash
OL,4,Awith bin lorry in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver is in a critical condition
OL,7,Fafter his vehicle collided with a bin
OL,8,Florry in South Lanarkshire.
OL,10,FPolice were alerted to the crash on the
OL,11,FA70 Edinburgh Road in Carnwath village
OL,12,Fat about 14:40 on Friday.
OL,14,FThe 70-year-old bus driver - who was
OL,15,Fthe only occupant - was taken by air
OL,16,Fambulance to the Queen Elizabeth
OL,17,FUniversity Hospital in Glasgow.
OL,19,FOfficers said the 51-year-old male
OL,20,Fpassenger of the bin lorry was also
OL,21,Ftaken to hospital and is in a stable
OL,22,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
